        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(d) The amounts of Lucent Award and Business Group Award, if earned, are based on the performance results of Lucent and the employee's applicable Business Group at the end of each fiscal year compared against business goals which are established at the beginning of each fiscal year.",
